Chaos Lab is an open-source, vendor-neutral adversarial systems laboratory for deterministic failure injection, fault campaigns, process death, transport disruption, persistence corruption, resource exhaustion, stale authority, restart behavior, and recovery validation across distributed AI infrastructure.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Chaos Lab does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Chaos Lab accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
